Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:04.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}The crowd loss, on three\Ndials, at unseen settings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.13,0:00:08.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}On the good machine,\Nit halves the crowd-law residuals,
