Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.71,0:00:16.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}But the spread of energy changes shrinks\Nby a quarter: a faint echo of the spike.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.66,0:00:20.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}On a deliberately biased\Nmachine, it fails:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:23.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}one run diverged, the other got worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:25.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}On the crossing rate, with one seed:
